[WORK]
UID: WORK-BOARD-PERSPECTIVE-CELL-FONT
TITLE: Perspective cells ignore the theme monospace font
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The Aurora theme (docs/sdoc/board/assets/theme.css) declares JetBrains Mono
first in --psp-interface-monospace--font-family, but Perspective's datagrid
cells compute to the ui-monospace fallback stack: the variable is not reaching
the cells. Measured 2026-09-01 by headless chromium against the live server
while matching the Plan tab's font size to Perspective's 12px cells. Cosmetic;
find which --psp-* property the datagrid actually reads for cell type and set
that, or accept the fallback and drop the dead declaration.
<<<
